step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test the best_single strategy with the strong THETA model to see if a single model outperforms the baseline mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"THETA"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over the full pool to see if a robust average improves over the plain mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a robust median over the most stable small pool (pool1) to see if it beats plain mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test dba on pool1 to see if a DTW barycenter of the 5 most stable models improves over mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Evaluate a robust median combination on the moderately stable pool2 to see if it improves over mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the more stable pool3 to see if it beats the plain mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test the dba combination on pool2 to see if a more focused barycenter improves over previous attempts.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over the more stable pool3 to see if robustness improves on this series.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool3","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over the more stable pool3 to see if it improves over trimmed mean and mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the most stable pool2 using the existing w1 handle, hoping the harness will apply it to the subset.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ETS","THETA","DWT_rf","DWT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_rf","ONLY_DWT_catboost"],"weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the most stable pool4 to see if it improves over the plain mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a plain mean over the most stable pool4 to see if it beats the baseline mean of all models.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the most stable pool4 to see if robustness improves over mean/weighted.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

